## Deployment & Usage

### Prerequisites

```bash
# Required tools
- Terraform v1.x (for infrastructure)
- AWS CLI v2 (for AWS authentication)
- SSH keys (for EC2 access)
- Git (for version control)
```

### Quick Start

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/mosesekerin/hng-infrastructure.git
cd hng-infrastructure/environments/prod

# Configure AWS credentials
aws configure

# Deploy infrastructure
terraform plan    # Review what will be created
terraform apply   # Deploy (takes ~3-5 minutes)

# Get access information
terraform output

# Access dashboards
# Prometheus: http://<public-ip>:9090
# Grafana: http://<public-ip>:3000
# Nginx: https://<domain-name>
```

