## Monitoring & Observability

### What You Can Monitor

**System Health:**
- CPU utilization (per-core and aggregate)
- Memory usage (free, cached, buffers)
- Disk space (per filesystem)
- System load average (1m, 5m, 15m)

**Network Performance:**
- Bytes sent/received per interface
- Packet loss and errors
- Connection counts
- Bandwidth utilization

**Alerts Configured:**
- High CPU (>80% for 5 minutes)
- Critical CPU (>95% for 2 minutes)
- Low memory (<20% free)
- Critical memory (<10% free)
- Low disk space (<15% free)
- Critical disk space (<5% free)
- High load average (>4)
- Network interface down
- High network traffic (>100Mbps)

### Pre-Built Dashboards

1. **System Health Dashboard**
   - CPU usage gauge with color-coded thresholds
   - Memory usage gauge
   - System load timeseries (1m, 5m, 15m)
   - Disk usage gauge by filesystem

2. **Network Metrics Dashboard**
   - Network receive rate (bytes/sec)
   - Network transmit rate (bytes/sec)
   - Packet loss indicators
   - Connection monitoring

### Access & Credentials

- **URL:** http://<instance-ip>:3000
- **Default Credentials:** admin/admin
- **Datasource:** Prometheus (pre-configured)
- **Retention:** 15+ days of historical metrics

