## Security Features

### Infrastructure Security

✅ **Network Security**
- VPC isolation
- Security groups (least-privilege)
- UFW firewall enabled
- SSH on restricted port with key-based auth

✅ **Server Security**
- SSH key-only authentication (no password)
- PermitRootLogin disabled
- Security updates enabled (unattended-upgrades)
- SELinux / AppArmor ready

✅ **Application Security**
- HTTPS enforced (Let's Encrypt)
- Security headers implemented
- HSTS for SSL/TLS pinning
- X-Frame-Options to prevent clickjacking
- X-Content-Type-Options to prevent MIME sniffing

### Recommended Production Hardening

⚠️ Change Grafana default credentials  
⚠️ Restrict Prometheus access to trusted IPs  
⚠️ Configure alert notification channels  
⚠️ Enable audit logging  
⚠️ Implement WAF rules (AWS Shield)

